{"title":"2022 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the  <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal#17\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal\">2022 CEMC Pascal #17</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Cayley#15\" title=\"2022 CEMC Cayley\">2022 CEMC Cayley #15</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<p>The integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> satisfy the equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/b/f0b7aa13b7156b68b6d71f4c3f957471daf2687c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + 5 = b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/e/5ce30065f37599dc5d9c35513697c44fbf335591.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + b = c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/4/684c57f935de8870397140913fdcde7134d89887.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + c = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />. The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/f/dafa9711e0af2b7142386f1c2d31382e9683fd88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ -30 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ -20 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ -10 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 0 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"482\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging the first equation into the last, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/4/d4468d855f789b73a23568d6f081335dd21d1443.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + 5 + c = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/7/bc76d5783530d98810ac68501a5dcb7283d02ad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = -5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>We can then plug this into the second equation:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/e/9de04e8a0101a2169b262ec24b66f37ea2fa138f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + b = -5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> from both sides, we see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/f/0ef5db4c0908e891fc0dc182a9567c9b6fcc1349.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } -10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"121\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging the last equation into the first, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/4/a04385fa684a4c9ba8ad5f68b2dfd6753d75641e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + c + 5 = b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/7/bc76d5783530d98810ac68501a5dcb7283d02ad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = -5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Just like solution 1, we can then plug-in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/7/bc76d5783530d98810ac68501a5dcb7283d02ad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = -5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" /> into the second equation. This leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/f/0ef5db4c0908e891fc0dc182a9567c9b6fcc1349.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } -10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"121\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging the second equation into the last, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/b/eebf76702aaa216e9b99c317cb0bdef1e999b909.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + 5 + b = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Combining like terms, we see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/6/b96cb0b237341a6a78a3e06d4004350754314ae9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b + 5 = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Plugging this into the first equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/7/a5751ce4ae533d76614325c5e48e3102477031d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b + 5 + 5 = b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/b/bdb915d73dced4221f9e78b20e4d14d5226d7fb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b + 10 = b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> from both sides, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28d710355e475d0848ddb359a0c713ade24126.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b + 10 - b - 10 = b - b - 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"232\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Combining like terms on both sides, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/f/0ef5db4c0908e891fc0dc182a9567c9b6fcc1349.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } -10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"121\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can add all of the equations together. This gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/5/965426bbcab05206acc561c45f9b1523e3374119.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + 5 + 5 + b + b + c = b + c + a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"258\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/d/49d651c836237045c485c37932e9dc0ae600bdd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 5 + b = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Simplifying the left side and moving it to the right, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/f/0ef5db4c0908e891fc0dc182a9567c9b6fcc1349.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } -10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"121\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal\">2022 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 16 (page does not exist)\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 18 (page does not exist)\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 13 (page does not exist)\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 14 (page does not exist)\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 15 (page does not exist)\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 16 (page does not exist)\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_17\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 18 (page does not exist)\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 19 (page does not exist)\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"20